\newlabel{tab:crossmodel}{{5}{6}{Cross-model comparison: Qwen3-0.6B (3 generations) vs.\ Qwen2.5-1.5B (5 generations), LoRA $K$=4. All four findings replicate across model families and scales. The 1.5B models run for 5 generations with no divergence in diversity dynamics}{table.caption.9}{}}
